    "detailed_description": "<h1>What to expect from this game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a low-budget game made mostly by one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look at the game's Community Hub for known issues and solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter some bugs/crashes, please let me know on the forums so I can fix them.</p></p><br><h1>Full Controller Support</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an Xbox-compatible or PlayStation 4/5 controller  for the best experience!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHEN YOU THOUGHT IT'S ALL OVER... A NEW CHAPTER BEGINS! \ud83d\udc01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident that made you retire from adventuring, you landed a safe job  at the Royal Castle as a cook. Upon the Queen's request, you must venture once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE 3D ENVIRONMENTS - GATHER, FIGHT, INVESTIGATE  RUINS, GO FISHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk across small, hand-crafted areas. Gather cooking ingredients and materials for alchemy and upgrades. Fulfill side quests, and learn more about your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >18 INTERACTIVE SEX SCENES WITH 12 DIFFERENT CHARACTERS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get intimate with your friends! Customize expression, select animation style and speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also receive 18 nudes via magic crystal communicator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip fights if you only want to enjoy the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D RPG-esque adventuring brings a new layer to the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of characters of different races, backgrounds, and tropes, including: maid, office lady, shy nerd, stern teacher, troubled smith, gloomy shopkeeper, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-handed controls - most of gameplay mechanics can be operated only with the mouse</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHEN YOU THOUGHT IT'S ALL OVER... A NEW CHAPTER BEGINS! \ud83d\udc01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident that made you retire from adventuring, you landed a safe job  at the Royal Castle as a cook. Upon the Queen's request, you must venture once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/0cfcfca8fa5d9d53fb1ab996c4ada8ad.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE 3D ENVIRONMENTS - GATHER, FIGHT, INVESTIGATE  RUINS, GO FISHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk across small, hand-crafted areas. Gather cooking ingredients and materials for alchemy and upgrades. Fulfill side quests, and learn more about your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/410def156054c8a2ecfcebb87a3f4c61.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >18 INTERACTIVE SEX SCENES WITH 12 DIFFERENT CHARACTERS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get intimate with your friends! Customize expression, select animation style and speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also receive 18 nudes via magic crystal communicator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.poster.avif?t=1746473785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.webm?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411490/extras/3a007a7b325da704ac611272425b6789.mp4?t=1746473785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip fights if you only want to enjoy the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D RPG-esque adventuring brings a new layer to the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of characters of different races, backgrounds, and tropes, including: maid, office lady, shy nerd, stern teacher, troubled smith, gloomy shopkeeper, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-handed controls - most of gameplay mechanics can be operated only with the mouse</p></li></ul>",
